[{"id":"w3-verbs","title":"動詞と文型","source":"教材③","level":"標準〜発展","focus":"動詞の語法","description":"文型を形だけでなく、動詞がどんな関係を作るかで判断する。","questions":[{"id":"41ab93dd-99e1-4b41-823e-8e4cccd05169","type":"choice","prompt":"文型を判定してください。","sentence":"The situation changed dramatically.","choices":["SV","SVC","SVO","SVOO","SVOC"],"answer":"SV","skill":"verb-pattern","note":""},{"id":"34f482b1-ed88-461d-a129-eb46b2527e70","type":"choice","prompt":"文型を判定してください。","sentence":"The news made everyone nervous.","choices":["SV","SVC","SVO","SVOO","SVOC"],"answer":"SVOC","skill":"verb-pattern","note":""},{"id":"62604e6c-21df-4088-add2-5041fda6805a","type":"choice","prompt":"文型を判定してください。","sentence":"The teacher gave the students useful advice.","choices":["SV","SVC","SVO","SVOO","SVOC"],"answer":"SVOO","skill":"verb-pattern","note":""},{"id":"06d98d70-ca19-4cfb-8059-88a50cc5fd33","type":"choice","prompt":"文型を判定してください。","sentence":"His explanation sounded reasonable.","choices":["SV","SVC","SVO","SVOO","SVOC"],"answer":"SVC","skill":"verb-pattern","note":""},{"id":"94488258-392d-44b9-8673-364b2a1a265d","type":"choice","prompt":"文型を判定してください。","sentence":"He runs every morning.","choices":["SV","SVC","SVO","SVOO","SVOC"],"answer":"SV","skill":"verb-pattern","note":""},{"id":"3592a87e-467d-4d6a-95b6-391c085d1c67","type":"choice","prompt":"文型を判定してください。","sentence":"He runs a restaurant.","choices":["SV","SVC","SVO","SVOO","SVOC"],"answer":"SVO","skill":"verb-pattern","note":""},{"id":"9565e80e-2a30-4af5-af35-0ecf5f617c48","type":"choice","prompt":"文型を判定してください。","sentence":"The tree grew quickly.","choices":["SV","SVC","SVO","SVOO","SVOC"],"answer":"SV","skill":"verb-pattern","note":""},{"id":"5ca0d43b-683a-417a-af86-ccb1c95f8b6c","type":"choice","prompt":"文型を判定してください。","sentence":"They grow vegetables.","choices":["SV","SVC","SVO","SVOO","SVOC"],"answer":"SVO","skill":"verb-pattern","note":""},{"id":"33234590-0e47-4c39-a2d7-752e06a6a8ee","type":"choice","prompt":"文型を判定してください。","sentence":"She looks tired.","choices":["SV","SVC","SVO","SVOO","SVOC"],"answer":"SVC","skill":"verb-pattern","note":""},{"id":"5c423f89-a3f1-497b-9cff-e74b54a74d7e","type":"choice","prompt":"文型を判定してください。","sentence":"She looked at me.","choices":["SV","SVC","SVO","SVOO","SVOC"],"answer":"SV","skill":"verb-pattern","note":""},{"id":"696e9656-67fb-4909-ae07-183e25247af1","type":"manual","prompt":"同じ run でも文型が変わるのはなぜ？","sentence":"He runs every morning. / He runs a restaurant.","skill":"verb-pattern","guide":"動詞の後ろとの意味関係に注目。"},{"id":"2dba9492-884d-440c-8c94-81cf93170e4d","type":"manual","prompt":"happy がCになる理由を説明してください。","sentence":"She looks happy.","skill":"verb-pattern","guide":"She = happy の関係を使う。"},{"id":"34efbe7e-3ea2-462f-b0d8-e566bb922f75","type":"choice","prompt":"次の文で 'open' の役割は？","sentence":"He kept the door open.","choices":["O","C","M","V"],"answer":"C","skill":"svoc","note":""},{"id":"f2b0ba42-ecd3-4345-992e-e66fb70876f7","type":"choice","prompt":"次の文で 'yesterday' の役割は？","sentence":"They watched the movie yesterday.","choices":["O","C","M","V"],"answer":"M","skill":"modifiers","note":""}]},{"id":"w3-verbforms","title":"ing / to do と語法","source":"教材③","level":"標準〜発展","focus":"動詞＋ing / to do","description":"訳の丸暗記ではなく、動詞と後ろの形の時間・意味関係を見る。","questions":[{"id":"1b80bd3d-eed1-49a3-8d4e-cb39bb76445c","type":"fields","prompt":"空欄に適切な形を入れてください。","sentence":"I decided ___ abroad. (study)","fields":[{"id":"answer","label":"答え","answers":["to study"]}],"skill":"verb-form","note":""},{"id":"8c8ed5d6-51c2-4f62-9447-1ea61f871487","type":"fields","prompt":"空欄に適切な形を入れてください。","sentence":"I enjoy ___ English. (study)","fields":[{"id":"answer","label":"答え","answers":["studying"]}],"skill":"verb-form","note":""},{"id":"65c8b77b-9718-4239-a8e4-c37db62b429c","type":"fields","prompt":"空欄に適切な形を入れてください。","sentence":"She avoided ___ him. (meet)","fields":[{"id":"answer","label":"答え","answers":["meeting"]}],"skill":"verb-form","note":""},{"id":"31c775f7-09d2-41df-a8b2-97746dfd65e1","type":"fields",